[00:20.50]The living and true God—
[00:23.91]The God of all creation
[00:30.54]In ev’ry generation—
[00:35.67]Jehovah is your name.
[00:40.66]We’re honored and we’re proud
[00:45.60]To be your congregation.
[00:50.72]In ev’ry tribe and nation,
[00:53.90]Your glory we proclaim.
[01:00.41](Chorus)
[01:00.56]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[01:05.86]There is no God like you.
[01:10.56]There’s no other in the heavens
[01:14.96]Or on the earth below.
[01:20.70]You alone are God Almighty,
[01:26.12]And this all men must know.
[01:30.31]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[01:35.81]We have no other God but you.
[01:51.10]You cause us to become
[01:56.44]Whatever you desire,
[02:00.17]To do as you require—
[02:04.92]Jehovah is your name.
[02:11.58]And Witnesses for you
[02:14.66]Is what you’ve kindly named us.
[02:21.70]We’re honored you have claimed us—
[02:26.68]A people for your name.
[02:31.90](Chorus)
[02:32.05]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[02:36.80]There is no God like you.
[02:41.54]There’s no other in the heavens
[02:46.96]Or on the earth below.
[02:51.52]You alone are God Almighty,
[02:57.10]And this all men must know.
[03:02.49]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[03:06.38]We have no other God but you.
